{"id":557569556,"iid":266064,"project_id":278964,"title":"Use find_by_id in ImportRequirementsCsvWorker","description":"## What does this MR do and why?\n\nFixes the `Gitlab/NoFindInWorkers` offense in `RequirementsManagement::ImportRequirementsCsvWorker` by replacing `find` with `find_by_id` and skipping the job when a record is missing.\n\nIt also removes the worker from the `Gitlab/NoFindInWorkers` RuboCop todo.\n\n## References\n\nRelated to #552030\n\nSupersedes !261334, which could not be rebased because of conflicts in `.rubocop_todo/gitlab/no_find_in_workers.yml`.\n\n## How to set up and validate locally\n\n```shell\nbundle exec rubocop ee/app/workers/requirements_management/import_requirements_csv_worker.rb\nbundle exec rspec ee/spec/workers/requirements_management/import_requirements_csv_worker_spec.rb\n```\n\n## MR acceptance checklist\n\nEvaluate this MR against the [MR acceptance checklist](https://docs.gitlab.com/development/code_review/#acceptance-checklist). It helps you analyze changes to reduce risks in quality, performance, reliability, security, and maintainability.","state":"closed","created_at":"2026-10-28T23:10:17.817Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:25:44.465Z","merged_by":null,"merge_user":null,"merged_at":null,"closed_by":{"id":43108451,"username":"Z-Haneen","public_email":"","name":"Haneen Zarifa","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7a6db31ddb8fad5113ef546edb0ef7a37f85297c5f396793e8a77f534ad65635?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/Z-Haneen"},"closed_at":"2026-10-28T23:25:44.192Z","target_branch":"master","source_branch":"fix-no-find-in-workers-requirements-csv-v2","user_notes_count":7,"upvotes":0,"downvotes":0,"author":{"id":43108451,"username":"Z-Haneen","public_email":"","name":"Haneen Zarifa","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7a6db31ddb8fad5113ef546edb0ef7a37f85297c5f396793e8a77f534ad65635?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://